        <mxCell id="qaGLzAXyBNemOFgg5PHx-66" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontStyle=0;movable=1;resizable=1;rotatable=1;deletable=1;editable=1;locked=0;connectable=1;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;LOGIN NO APLICATIVO DO BANCO&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="1320" x="20" y="670" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="qaGLzAXyBNemOFgg5PHx-65" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;movable=1;resizable=1;rotatable=1;deletable=1;editable=1;locked=0;connectable=1;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;atores&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt; &lt;/b&gt;cliente e banco;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;resumo&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;O&lt;br/&gt;cliente entra no aplicativo do banco, o aplicativo verifica se os dados e senha&lt;br/&gt;do cliente, quando os dados são confirmados o cliente, ele pode escolher entre&lt;br/&gt;realizar pagamentos/transferências, consultar o saldo ou sair do aplicativo.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;pré-condições:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;- o aplicativo deve ser acessado;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;- o banco deve confirmar as informações/ações do cliente.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;fluxo principal:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;.&amp;nbsp;o cliente tenta fazer login no aplicativo;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;2&lt;/b&gt;. o aplicativo verifica a senha do cliente;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;3&lt;/b&gt;. o login é feito com sucesso;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4&lt;/b&gt;. o cliente escolhe entre consultar saldo, realizar pagamento e realizar transferência;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;5&lt;/b&gt;. o banco verifica se há saldo o suficiente, caso seja escolhido entre realizar pagamentos ou realizar transferências;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;6&lt;/b&gt;. há saldo suficiente conta;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;7&lt;/b&gt;. o cliente escolhe entre pagar da conta corrente ou conta poupança;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;8&lt;/b&gt;. a sessão é finalizada com sucesso.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;fluxo alternativo 1:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;.&amp;nbsp; o cliente pode desistir da ação a qualquer momento.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;fluxo alternativo 2:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;. caso o aplicativo detecte erro na senha, na linha &lt;i&gt;1 &lt;/i&gt;do fluxo principal;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;2&lt;/b&gt;. o aplicativo comunica um erro de login ao cliente;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;3&lt;/b&gt;. a sessão é finalizada.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;fluxo alternativo 3:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;. caso seja verificado que não há saldo suficiente no item &lt;i&gt;5 &lt;/i&gt;do fluxo principal;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;2&lt;/b&gt;. a transferência/pagamento não pode ser realizado.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;pós-condições:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 17px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;o cliente conseguiu realizar seu pagamento/transferência.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;regras de negócio:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;- o cliente deve acessar o aplicativo;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;- o aplicativo deve estar funcionando normalmente;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;o banco deve prestar suporte ao cliente.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="850" width="1320" x="20" y="730" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
